<title>USA: AMB Financial completes share repurchase.</title>
<headline>AMB Financial completes share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>MUNSTER, Ind. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMB Financial Corp, a holding company for American Savings FSB, said Tuesday it has completed the repurchase of 50,726 of its shares representing five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>A stock repurchase program was announced in April 1997. The shares were purchased at an average price of $14.54 per share.</p>
<p>After the repurchase, AMB Financial has 963,798 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>As of March 31, 1997, AMB Financial had assets of $93.6 million.</p>
<p>			((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
